't."], [0, "1 in 4 taxpaying Americans has paid the price of identity fraud."], [1, "What do I do? My refund, though\u2014 I'm freaking out."], [0, "Don't worry, I can fix this. LifeLock fixes identity theft guaranteed and gets your money back with up to $3 million in coverage."], [1, "I'm so relieved."], [0, "No problem, I'll be with with you."], [1, "Every step of the way."]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": ["Society & Culture"]}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_template": "Analyze conversation in terms of topic interests of the participants. Analyze the conversation (provided in structured XML format) where <p0> has the questions and <p1> has the answers. Return comma-delimited tags. Only return the tags without any English commentary.", "output_variable": "final_output", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["border wall", "mexico border town", "early morning work", "street vendors", "dental tourism", "american visitors", "crossing restriction", "immigration barrier", "podcast credits", "audio production", "identity theft", "tax fraud", "border security", "tourism economy", "marketing advertisement", "financial anxiety", "consumer protection", "insurance coverage"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
